## Project Architecture

### Monorepo Structure
```
Mafia-Wars/
├── package.json                 # Root workspace
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml          # Packages + catalog + security (minimumReleaseAge: 1440)
├── tsconfig.json / base.json    # TypeScript project references
├── artifacts/
│   ├── api-server/              # Express + Socket.io backend
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── index.ts         # Entry point
│   │   │   ├── app.ts           # Express setup
│   │   │   ├── socket-handlers.ts  # ALL game logic
│   │   │   ├── lib/logger.ts    # Pino logger
│   │   │   └── routes/          # REST endpoints
│   │   └── build.mjs            # esbuild bundle
│   ├── game-lobby/              # React + Vite frontend
│   │   ├── src/
