## Development Workflow & Rules

- **DEV_GUIDE.md Rule**: After completing any task, update `DEV_GUIDE.md` in the project root only. Create it if it doesn't exist yet with a header containing the project name, tech stack summary, and a plain one-paragraph game description. Maintain two sections inside it: a Features checklist of all completed features with one-line descriptions per feature, and a Changes Log with a dated entry per task showing which files changed, what changed and why, and simple manual browser testing steps. Keep the whole file plain, jargon-free, and readable at a glance.
- **Testing Rules**: Never create test cases, test files, test suites, testing infrastructure, or extra files of any kind unless explicitly asked.
- **README Rule**: Never modify `README.md`.